---
// src/components/home/WorkflowSection.astro
// Exact Pen.dev "Empat Pilar Filantropi" Descending 4-Card Staggered Waterfall
---

<section class="pen-philanthropy-section reveal-on-scroll" id="empat-pilar-filantropi">
  <div class="pen-philanthropy-container">
    <div class="pen-philanthropy-header">
      <div class="pen-header-left">
        <h2 class="pen-section-title">
          Infak, Sedekah, Zakat, dan Wakaf:<br />
          Empat Instrumen Filantropi, Satu Gerakan Kebaikan
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-header-right">
        <p class="pen-section-desc">
          Melalui pengelolaan yang amanah, transparan, dan sesuai prinsip syariah, Global Village Fund menghubungkan kontribusi filantropi dengan berbagai kebutuhan dan pengembangan ekosistem Skill Village. Setiap instrumen dikelola berdasarkan karakter dan peruntukannya untuk mendukung pembangunan fasilitas, pemenuhan kebutuhan, pengembangan pendidikan, serta penguatan sarana produktif.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pen-waterfall-grid">
      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-1">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/asrama-putra-baru/pembangunan-asrama-ikhwan-baru.jpeg"
            alt="Infak - Mendukung Pembangunan Fasilitas"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <span class="pen-pillar-badge">01. INFAK</span>
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Mendukung Pembangunan Fasilitas</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Kontribusi infak dimanfaatkan untuk memenuhi kebutuhan material dan perlengkapan konstruksi dalam pembangunan serta pengembangan fasilitas, termasuk Masjid Khairu Ummah Sugro dan sarana penunjang lainnya.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-2">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/masjid-dan-kelas/sayuran-kangkung.jpeg"
            alt="Sedekah - Memenuhi Kebutuhan dan Menunjang Aktivitas"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <span class="pen-pillar-badge">02. SEDEKAH</span>
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Memenuhi Kebutuhan dan Menunjang Aktivitas</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Sedekah disalurkan untuk membantu pemenuhan kebutuhan pangan, nutrisi, perlengkapan, dan kebutuhan harian santri agar aktivitas di lingkungan pesantren dapat berjalan dengan baik.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-3">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/beras-zakat-fitrah-mustahik.webp"
            alt="Zakat - Mendukung Pendidikan dan Kesejahteraan Mustahik"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <span class="pen-pillar-badge">03. ZAKAT</span>
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Mendukung Pendidikan dan Kesejahteraan Mustahik</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Dana zakat disalurkan kepada penerima yang memenuhi kriteria asnaf, termasuk dukungan pendidikan bagi santri dari keluarga kurang mampu yang memenuhi ketentuan sebagai mustahik.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pen-pillar-card card-step-4">
        <div class="pen-pillar-thumb">
          <img
            src="https://br-billowing-mountain-aomqpcdy.storage.c-2.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/gvf-website/gvf/assets/bahan-konten/fasilitas-dan-infrastruktur/drone-lapangan-dan-lahan-tani.webp"
            alt="Wakaf - Mengembangkan Aset dan Potensi Produktif"
            class="pen-thumb-img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pen-pillar-content">
          <span class="pen-pillar-badge">04. WAKAF</span>
          <h3 class="pen-pillar-title">Mengembangkan Aset dan Potensi Produktif</h3>
          <p class="pen-pillar-desc">
            Wakaf diarahkan pada pengadaan, pengembangan, dan pengelolaan aset, termasuk lahan serta fasilitas produktif yang mendukung pengembangan kawasan pendidikan, ibadah, dan agro-technopark.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pen-card-watermark" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pen-bottom-cta">
      <a href="https://wa.me/6287865994786?text=Assalamu'alaikum%20Admin%20GVF,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20program%20filantropi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="pen-bottom-cta-link">
        Mulai Kebaikan Abadi Bersama Kami di Sukasirna Jonggol. Konsultasikan Program Gratis ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pen-philanthropy-section {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 100px 0 120px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pen-philanthropy-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
  }

  /* Header Split Row */
  .pen-philanthropy-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 70px;
  }

  .pen-header-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .pen-badge-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 5px 14px 5px 10px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    box-shadow: 0px 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border-radius: 32px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .dot-halo {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .halo-ring {
    position: absolute;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(9, 105, 218, 0.12);
  }

  .core-dot {
    position: relative;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0969da;
  }

  .badge-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: normal;
    color: #000000;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-section-title {
    font-size: 42px;
    line-height: 50px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-header-right {
    max-width: 420px;
    padding-top: 50px;
  }

  .pen-section-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 25px;
    color: #62625b;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    text-align: justify;
    text-justify: inter-word;
    text-align-last: left;
  }

  /* 4-Card Waterfall Staggered Grid */
  .pen-waterfall-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pen-pillar-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    transition: transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .pen-pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  /* Staggered Vertical Offsets exact Pen.dev */
  @media (min-width: 1025px) {
    .card-step-1 {
      margin-top: 0px;
    }
    .card-step-2 {
      margin-top: 45px;
    }
    .card-step-3 {
      margin-top: 90px;
    }
    .card-step-4 {
      margin-top: 135px;
    }
  }

  /* Image Thumbnail */
  .pen-pillar-thumb {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .pen-thumb-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 300ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .pen-pillar-card:hover .pen-thumb-img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  /* Content */
  .pen-pillar-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .pen-pillar-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0969da;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-pillar-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .pen-pillar-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 22px;
    color: #62625b;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    text-align: justify;
    text-justify: inter-word;
    text-align-last: left;
  }

  /* Big Faint Watermark Number at Bottom */
  .pen-card-watermark {
    font-size: 72px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    margin-top: 24px;
    text-align: right;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  /* Bottom Kicker CTA */
  .pen-bottom-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 90px;
  }

  .pen-bottom-cta-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #0969da;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', system-ui, sans-serif;
    transition: color 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), transform 180ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .pen-bottom-cta-link:hover {
    color: #0752a8;
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .pen-bottom-cta-link:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .pen-philanthropy-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .pen-header-right {
      padding-top: 0;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .pen-waterfall-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .card-step-1, .card-step-2, .card-step-3, .card-step-4 {
      margin-top: 0 !important;
    }

    .pen-section-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pen-waterfall-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .pen-bottom-cta {
      margin-top: 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
